## 1. Exact conclusion and source scope

Let k be a characteristic-zero field. Suppose A,B in k[g,p] have (2,1)-weighted degrees21,35, weighted leaders H^3,H^5, and

    H=p*(p^2-g)^2*(p^2-(3/2)g),     [A,B]_(g,p)=c*g, c in k*,

